        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>气测解释的第一步是<b>分段</b>：在 1—5 m 一点的全烃曲线上圈出「有油气显示」的井段；第二步是<b>定性</b>：看这一段的气体「湿不湿」，判断是油层、气层还是水层。这两步现在全靠解释员坐在屏幕前一遍遍地看曲线，一口井 3000—4000 m 的井段通常要 2 h 以上。</p><p>麻烦在于曲线从来不干净。同一段实测曲线上至少叠了三种成分：<b>背景气</b>（钻井液里的残余气与脱气效率漂移，让整条曲线随井深缓慢抬升）、<b>接单根气</b>（停泵接单根后恢复循环时冒出来的窄尖峰）、<b>油气显示</b>（真正的储层贡献）。三者的峰值可以一样高，形态却完全不同——而薄油气层的显示常常比背景气还低，一不小心就漏掉。更要命的是<b>没有真值</b>：一口井解释成油层还是气层，只能等试油或投产来验证，一个区块攒 200—500 段标签要几年。</p><div class='figure'><svg viewBox='0 0 660 210' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='气测全烃曲线里叠加的三种成分'><text x='34' y='23' font-size='9.5' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' letter-spacing='1.2'>全烃 %</text><rect x='34' y='30' width='400' height='120' rx='5' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e3dccd'/><path d='M42 138.0 L426 130.0' stroke='#a9742c' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='5 4' fill='none'/><path d='M42 137.77 L46 136.18 L58 138.17 L66 135.69 L68 127.58 L70 117.73 L74 137.22 L76 139.06 L90 136.08 L94 136.97 L96 132.95 L98 119.95 L100 110.19 L102 119.52 L104 131.53 L106 134.83 L114 137.42 L122 137.18 L126 135.66 L138 136.93 L144 134.46 L150 126.86 L152 125.01 L158 122.13 L162 119.07 L170 116.26 L174 117.33 L184 115.03 L188 113.46 L200 115.11 L206 113.37 L218 116.8 L224 115.91 L232 118 L238 122.95 L242 125.57 L248 132.09 L250 132.09 L254 133.94 L262 134.55 L268 132.77 L280 134.26 L286 131.7 L294 131.72 L298 132.54 L300 130.33 L302 124.86 L304 115.71 L308 91.94 L310 86.78 L312 91.73 L316 117.22 L318 126.07 L320 130.42 L322 132.28 L324 132.76 L330 130.78 L342 132.1 L348 130.23 L356 131.63 L360 133.1 L370 130.51 L378 127.35 L382 124.85 L390 126.77 L396 130.49 L404 131.39 L408 129.89 L422 131.54 L426 129.5' fill='none' stroke='#4a585c' stroke-width='1.4'/><rect x='42' y='42' width='384' height='100' fill='none'/><text x='85' y='104' font-size='9' fill='#355c74' text-anchor='middle'>接单根气</text><text x='196' y='108' font-size='9' fill='#83551f' text-anchor='middle'>油层 · 宽而平</text><text x='310' y='76' font-size='9' fill='#123a3d' text-anchor='middle'>气层 · 窄而尖</text><text x='382' y='114' font-size='9' fill='#a64b3c' text-anchor='middle'>薄层被掩盖</text><text x='426' y='146' font-size='9' fill='#83551f' text-anchor='end'>背景气抬升</text><text x='100' y='164' font-size='9' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' text-anchor='middle'>3520</text><text x='200' y='164' font-size='9' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' text-anchor='middle'>3620</text><text x='300' y='164' font-size='9' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' text-anchor='middle'>3720</text><text x='400' y='164' font-size='9' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4' text-anchor='middle'>3820</text><text x='34' y='164' font-size='9' font-family='monospace' fill='#99a3a4'>井深 m</text><rect x='446' y='30' width='200' height='40' rx='5' fill='#faf7f0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='459' y='47' font-size='10.5' font-weight='600' fill='#123a3d'>背景气</text><text x='459' y='61' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>随钻井液密度、脱气效率慢漂移</text><rect x='446' y='78' width='200' height='40' rx='5' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='459' y='95' font-size='10.5' font-weight='600' fill='#355c74'>接单根气</text><text x='459' y='109' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>停泵—开泵的窄尖峰，周期性出现</text><rect x='446' y='126' width='200' height='40' rx='5' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#e3d2b0'/><text x='459' y='143' font-size='10.5' font-weight='600' fill='#83551f'>油气显示</text><text x='459' y='157' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>油宽平 · 气窄尖 · 水低而钝</text><text x='34' y='190' font-size='10' fill='#4a585c'>实测曲线 = 三者叠加：分段与定性都不能只看单点峰高</text><text x='34' y='204' font-size='9.5' fill='#99a3a4'>图中虚线是真背景气（实际解释时并不知道，要自己估）</text></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>图 1</b><span>气测解释难在哪：<b>背景气抬升</b>会跟着钻具一直漂，<b>接单根气</b>是准时来报到的窄尖峰，真正的<b>油气显示</b>形态各异（油层宽而平、气层窄而尖、水层低而钝），最右侧那个比背景气高不了多少的小鼓包就是薄层显示——单点阈值法必然漏掉它。</span></div>"
