        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>这里不做端到端黑箱，而是把解释员脑子里的三步判断写成可复算的算法：</p><p><b>① 基线校正</b>——用<b>滑动分位数</b>估计背景气：以当前点为中心取一个窗口（例如 40 点 ≈ 100 m），取窗口内 20% 分位数作为这一点的基线，实测曲线减基线得到校正曲线。用分位数而不用滑动平均，是因为分位数对「少数几个高值」不敏感：接单根窄峰不会把基线抬起来，也就不会被自己减掉。</p><p><b>② 异常段检测</b>——在校正曲线上先用<b>峰高</b>判据（校正值 &gt; k × 噪声 σ，σ 用中位数绝对偏差 MAD 估计）找候选点，再用<b>持续长度</b>判据（连续 ≥ 3 个点）把接单根那样的孤立窄峰筛掉，最后合并邻近段。峰高与长度必须同时用：只用峰高，接单根气全部算异常；只用长度，一整段背景漂移都是异常。</p><p><b>③ 流体性质判别</b>——把每个异常段的组分比（<b>C1/C2</b>、<b>C1/C3</b>，取峰区加权中位数）打到 <b>Pixler 双对数图版</b>上：比值小、重烃全 → 油区；比值中等、几乎是干气 → 气区；比值极大、幅度又低 → 水区。图版不是拍脑袋画的，落区边界来自本区已试油验证的井段统计。</p><div class='figure'><svg viewBox='0 0 660 210' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='基线校正与四步解释流程'><defs><marker id='ga2' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='6' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0 L6 3 L0 6 Z' fill='#c3cdc4'/></marker></defs><rect x='12' y='18' width='636' height='54' rx='5' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e3dccd'/><path d='M22 62.0 L632 58.0' stroke='#a9742c' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='5 4' fill='none'/><path d='M22 61.86 L25 62.1 L28 61.39 L31 60.84 L34 61.96 L37 62.64 L40 62.13 L43 62.34 L46 62.44 L49 61.17 L52 60.75 L55 61.7 L58 61.81 L61 61.73 L64 62.66 L67 62.54 L70 61.2 L73 61.07 L76 61.44 L79 60.95 L82 61.37 L85 62.61 L88 62.05 L91 55.74 L94 58.55 L97 61.19 L100 60.36 L103 61.11 L106 62.17 L109 61.81 L112 61.74 L115 62.11 L118 61.1 L121 60.2 L124 60.99 L127 61.44 L130 61.18 L133 61.94 L136 62.31 L139 61.07 L142 60.49 L145 60.97 L148 60.53 L151 55.96 L154 59.69 L157 62.09 L160 61.11 L163 61.06 L166 61.01 L169 60.03 L172 60.29 L175 61.57 L178 61.52 L181 61.18 L184 61.64 L187 61.03 L190 59.81 L193 60.24 L196 60.99 L199 60.74 L202 61.19 L205 61.94 L208 61 L211 60.02 L214 60.41 L217 60.35 L220 60.01 L223 61.09 L226 61.79 L229 60.89 L232 60.52 L235 60.69 L238 59.82 L241 59.57 L244 60.83 L247 61.21 L250 60.71 L253 61.07 L256 60.9 L259 59.58 L262 59.51 L265 60.45 L268 60.36 L271 60.49 L274 61.41 L277 60.93 L280 59.67 L283 59.8 L286 58.07 L289 55.1 L292 53.83 L295 53.36 L298 51.54 L301 49.92 L304 49.49 L307 48.41 L310 47.41 L313 48.23 L316 48.92 L319 48.37 L322 48.47 L325 48.66 L328 47.46 L331 46.87 L334 47.8 L337 48.02 L340 47.89 L343 48.83 L346 48.97 L349 47.81 L352 47.82 L355 48.66 L358 48.81 L361 49.91 L364 52.3 L367 53.59 L370 54.49 L373 56.92 L376 59.48 L379 58.55 L382 59.16 L385 60.31 L388 60.03 L391 59.87 L394 60.28 L397 59.39 L400 58.38 L403 59.07 L406 59.62 L409 59.35 L412 60.02 L415 60.53 L418 59.35 L421 58.64 L424 59.12 L427 58.86 L430 58.73 L433 59.97 L436 60.33 L439 59.34 L442 59.2 L445 59.23 L448 58.27 L451 58.37 L454 59.66 L457 59.71 L460 58.86 L463 56.12 L466 45.6 L469 33.05 L472 36.16 L475 49.58 L478 56.92 L481 59.07 L484 60.09 L487 59.29 L490 58.21 L493 58.54 L496 58.56 L499 58.16 L502 59.14 L505 59.98 L508 59.15 L511 58.67 L514 58.88 L517 58.08 L520 57.68 L523 58.89 L526 59.41 L529 58.89 L532 59.2 L535 59.15 L538 57.83 L541 57.58 L544 58.39 L547 57.91 L550 56.96 L553 56.7 L556 55.81 L559 55.07 L562 56.29 L565 57.56 L568 57.54 L571 58.26 L574 59.47 L577 58.99 L580 58.2 L583 58.43 L586 57.92 L589 57.14 L592 58.06 L595 58.99 L598 58.54 L601 58.58 L604 58.87 L607 57.74 L610 57.01 L613 57.89 L616 58.21 L619 58 L622 58.84 L625 59.04 L628 57.73 L631 57.32' fill='none' stroke='#99a3a4' stroke-width='1.3'/><text x='22' y='32' font-size='9.5' fill='#6f7a7c'>实测全烃（灰） + 估计的基线（虚线）</text><rect x='12' y='76' width='636' height='54' rx='5' fill='#faf7f0' stroke='#c8d9d1'/><path d='M22 122 L632 122' stroke='#1d4e50' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3' fill='none'/><path d='M22 110 L632 110' stroke='#a64b3c' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 3' fill='none'/><text x='630' y='107' font-size='9' fill='#a64b3c' text-anchor='end'>检出阈值</text><path d='M22 121.74 L25 122 L28 120.92 L31 119.9 L34 122 L37 122 L40 122 L43 122 L46 122 L49 120.76 L52 120 L55 121.84 L58 122 L61 121.98 L64 122 L67 122 L70 121.08 L73 120.86 L76 121.61 L79 120.72 L82 121.55 L85 122 L88 122 L91 110.96 L94 116.33 L97 121.39 L100 119.85 L103 121.33 L106 122 L109 122 L112 122 L115 122 L118 121.48 L121 119.82 L124 121.35 L127 122 L130 121.79 L133 122 L136 122 L139 121.68 L142 120.63 L145 121.58 L148 120.77 L151 112.12 L154 119.26 L157 122 L160 122 L163 121.98 L166 121.91 L169 120.09 L172 120.63 L175 122 L178 122 L181 122 L184 122 L187 122 L190 119.94 L193 120.78 L196 122 L199 121.81 L202 122 L205 122 L208 122 L211 120.59 L214 121.38 L217 121.29 L220 120.69 L223 122 L226 122 L229 122 L232 121.8 L235 122 L238 120.55 L241 120.11 L244 122 L247 122 L250 122 L253 122 L256 122 L259 120.35 L262 120.26 L265 122 L268 121.95 L271 122 L274 122 L277 122 L280 120.79 L283 121.08 L286 117.81 L289 112.22 L292 109.85 L295 108.98 L298 105.56 L301 102.53 L304 101.74 L307 99.72 L310 97.87 L313 99.47 L316 100.82 L319 99.81 L322 100.04 L325 100.44 L328 98.18 L331 97.11 L334 98.9 L337 99.36 L340 99.15 L343 100.97 L346 101.28 L349 99.11 L352 99.17 L355 100.81 L358 101.12 L361 103.26 L364 107.83 L367 110.31 L370 112.07 L373 116.72 L376 121.62 L379 119.9 L382 121.1 L385 122 L388 122 L391 122 L394 122 L397 121.72 L400 119.82 L403 121.18 L406 122 L409 121.78 L412 122 L415 122 L418 121.9 L421 120.59 L424 121.53 L427 121.08 L430 120.88 L433 122 L436 122 L439 122 L442 121.92 L445 122 L448 120.22 L451 120.44 L454 122 L457 122 L460 121.49 L463 116.32 L466 96.38 L469 76 L472 78.52 L475 104.05 L478 118.02 L481 122 L484 122 L487 122 L490 120.62 L493 121.29 L496 121.37 L499 120.64 L502 122 L505 122 L508 122 L511 121.76 L514 122 L517 120.71 L520 120 L523 122 L526 122 L529 122 L532 122 L535 122 L538 120.51 L541 120.07 L544 121.64 L547 120.78 L550 119.01 L553 118.54 L556 116.89 L559 115.53 L562 117.88 L565 120.34 L568 120.32 L571 121.74 L574 122 L577 122 L580 121.74 L583 122 L586 121.27 L589 119.84 L592 121.61 L595 122 L598 122 L601 122 L604 122 L607 121.2 L610 119.85 L613 121.55 L616 122 L619 121.84 L622 122 L625 122 L628 121.43 L631 120.7' fill='none' stroke='#1d4e50' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='22' y='90' font-size='9.5' fill='#123a3d'>校正后：背景气归零，异常段凸出来</text><rect x='12' y='138' width='144' height='58' rx='6' fill='#faf7f0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='24' y='156' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#123a3d'>① 基线校正</text><text x='24' y='171' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>滑动 20 点 · 20% 分位</text><text x='24' y='184' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>校正值 = 实测 − 基线</text><rect x='174' y='138' width='148' height='58' rx='6' fill='#e5ebf0' stroke='#cdd8e2'/><text x='186' y='156' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#355c74'>② 异常段提取</text><text x='186' y='171' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>校正值 &gt; k·σ 且</text><text x='186' y='184' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>连续 ≥ 3 个采样点</text><rect x='340' y='138' width='144' height='58' rx='6' fill='#f4e8d4' stroke='#e3d2b0'/><text x='352' y='156' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#83551f'>③ 组分比</text><text x='352' y='171' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>C1/C2 · C1/C3</text><text x='352' y='184' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>取峰区加权中位数</text><rect x='502' y='138' width='146' height='58' rx='6' fill='#e7eee9' stroke='#c8dbd2'/><text x='514' y='156' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#123a3d'>④ Pixler 图版</text><text x='514' y='171' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>双对数落点分区</text><text x='514' y='184' font-size='9' fill='#6f7a7c'>油区 / 气区 / 水区</text><path d='M158 167 L170 167' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#ga2)'/><path d='M324 167 L336 167' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#ga2)'/><path d='M486 167 L498 167' stroke='#c3cdc4' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#ga2)'/><text x='12' y='205' font-size='9.5' fill='#99a3a4'>四步全部可复算：换窗口、换阈值、换方法，落点与结论立刻跟着变</text></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>图 2</b><span>算法的四步：先估背景气基线（虚线）并减掉，再要求「峰高够 + 持续够」才算异常段，然后算段内组分比，最后把点打到 Pixler 图版上读结论。<b>校正前后并排看最直观</b>——上图里被背景气抬着走的曲线，下图一减就只剩几个凸起的异常段。</span></div>"
