        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p>气测数据的量不大，难在<b>对齐与去伪</b>：深度—时间的对应关系必须先理顺，钻井液参数必须同步进来，否则基线估计和阈值都无从谈起。下面五项里，第 3、4 项最容易被忽略，而它们决定算法能不能用。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 5</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>全烃与组分曲线</span><span class='cl-s'>总烃、C1—C5，1—5 m 一点，单井数千点</span></span><span class='cl-n'>检出率的分母</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>钻井液与工况参数</span><span class='cl-s'>密度、排量、钻时、接单根时间</span></span><span class='cl-n'>校正与干扰识别的前提</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>深度—时间对齐表</span><span class='cl-s'>迟到时间校正、钻具组合、录井仪型号</span></span><span class='cl-n'>曲线与井深必须能对上</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>解释段标签</span><span class='cl-s'>人工解释的异常段与油 / 气 / 水结论</span></span><span class='cl-n'>200—500 段起</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='4'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>试油 / 投产验证</span><span class='cl-s'>层段产量、含水、气油比</span></span><span class='cl-n'>唯一的真值来源</span></div></div>"
